This is the root directory of the PSCF package. See the README.md
file for basic instructions on usage and a link to the web manual.

Subdirectories:

  bin/      - default installation directory for executable files
  bld/      - build directory for out-of-source builds
  data/     - read-only data files (e.g., space group description files)
  docs/     - documentation, including web manual source files
  examples/ - input files for example calculations
  lib/      - scripts written in python or bash
  make/     - makefile fragments used by the configure script
  src/      - C++ and CUDA C++ source code files

Files:

  CONTENTS        - this file (directory contents)
  HISTORY         - summary of changes for each tagged version
  README.md       - brief intro to package (displayed on github)
  CONTRIBUTING.md - instructions for contributors
  LICENSE         - GNU GPL v3 license
  configure       - script for initial set up of the build system
  setopts         - script to manage compile-time options
  makefile        - main makefile (compiles out-of-source in bld/ )

